Korg ARP 2600m samples - These are arranged in an order where they get more experimental and synth as you go deeper into the bank.  Noise based hi hat sounds with a few wobbly LFO pitched percussion hits near the end of the knob for fun accents when CVing the Surface A knob. These sounds are more in line with traditional hi hat synthesis than the other 2600m bank but offer a few outlier samples to get weird with.}